WEBVTT

00:18:28.076 --> 00:18:30.716
which is the decline of war.

00:18:31.476 --> 00:18:34.836
So now we are back in a war
and potentially afterwards

00:18:34.876 --> 00:18:37.916
into a new form of cold war or hot war,

00:18:37.956 --> 00:18:39.516
but hopefully not.

00:18:39.956 --> 00:18:42.436
Elaborate about that essay you wrote.

00:18:42.916 --> 00:18:44.676
YNH: Yeah, I mean, some people think

00:18:44.716 --> 00:18:46.756
that all this talk
about the decline of war

00:18:46.756 --> 00:18:48.516
was always just a fantasy.

00:18:49.356 --> 00:18:50.516
But ...

00:18:50.996 --> 00:18:53.196
Again, you look at the statistics.

00:18:53.236 --> 00:18:54.716
Since 1945,

00:18:54.756 --> 00:18:58.436
there has not been a single clash
between superpowers,

00:18:58.476 --> 00:19:00.036
whereas previously in history,